  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 5 × 15 ÷ 5 + 22 - 18 = 25\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the numbers :\n\nOption 1) 22, 18\n\n5 × 15 ÷ 5 + 22 - 18 = 25 ⇒ 5 × 15 ÷ 5 + 18 - 22 = 25\n\n5 × __**15 ÷ 5**__ + 18 - 22 = 25\n\n__**5 × 3**__ + 18 - 22 = 25\n\n__**15 + 18**__ - 22 = 25\n\n__**33 - 22**__ = 25\n\n11 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 22, 25\n\n5 × 15 ÷ 5 + 22 - 18 = 25 ⇒ 5 × 15 ÷ 5 + 25 - 18 = 22\n\n5 × __**15 ÷ 5**__ + 25 - 18 = 22\n\n__**5 × 3**__ + 25 - 18 = 22\n\n__**15 + 25**__ - 18 = 22\n\n__**40 - 18**__ = 22\n\n**22 = 22 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) 5, 15\n\n5 × 15 ÷ 5 + 22 - 18 = 25 ⇒ 15 × 5 ÷ 15 + 22 - 18 = 25\n\n15 × __**5 ÷ 15**__ + 22 - 18 = 25\n\n__**15 × **____**0.33**__ + 22 - 18 = 25\n\n__**5 + 22**__ - 18 = 25\n\n__**27 - 18**__ = 25\n\n9 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 5, 25\n\n5 × 15 ÷ 5 + 22 - 18 = 25 ⇒ 25 × 15 ÷ 25 + 22 - 18 = 5\n\n25 × __**15 ÷ 25**__ + 22 - 18 = 5\n\n__**2**____**5 × 0.6**__ + 22 - 18 = 5\n\n__**15 + 22**__ - 18 = 5\n\n__**37 - 18**__ = 5\n\n19 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
